{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n 今日は京都の全国握手会\n ありがとうございましたー！\n \n ひなのとペアでした！\n ＡＢ型最年少最年長コンビでした！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNS6BEZFS9GNE0A162C60","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 学年で言うと9個差ですΣ（・□・；）\n \n ひなのは\n めちゃくちゃ可愛くて\n 我が子のようです〜\n \n にぶちゃんが妹なら\n ひなのは娘です🤱\n \n そんなひなのと\n めちゃくちゃ偶然\n カバンとパーカーがお揃いでした！\n \n まさかこんなことってあるんだ🌟\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNT75AKDWMVVE8GJEQAJB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNV88SE5EZP8CQ9394YZH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 9個も離れてるのに\n 物がお揃いになる奇跡🌟\n ＡＢ型って何か通ずるものがあるのかも知れませんね！\n \n ひなのとにぶちゃんに出会ってから\n ＡＢ型に愛着が湧いて\n ＡＢ型が好きになって\n ＡＢ型なことが誇りになりました！\n \n ではそんな感じで〜\n \n 今日もめちゃくちゃ楽しかったです！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNWAJPN0SV4M53PCEB4SZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNXA5BV55XZP8C5JE746F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNYAEZX8KDYJSZD83NZ46","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJNZC4Z6FWTBGVQ23JNMMT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJP0DY31XFZZ9P10DGGQWW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"}